    "ContentDesc_Des Händlers Liebesmüh (fortgeschritten)": "The dutiful mammet Memolivia listens to your every word with what you can only guess is rapt attention, speedily writing down the details in incomprehensible shorthand. It then begins trimming the text further until naught remains but concise descriptions of the fiercest battles you encountered in The Merchant's Tale. As you read the record over, you find that without the trappings of that wondrous story to soften them, the foes you faced were terrifying beyond your wildest imaginings...",
    "ContentName_The Merchant's Tale": "The Merchant's Tale",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_43626_Text": "Let our song ring ever louder!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_43631_Text": "Dance with me. Let the beat of our hearts guide our steps.",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_43737_Text": "Take up your weapon. I pray you can provide some measure of entertainment before you die.",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_43739_Text": "Run if you dare! Doom shall find you all the same!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_43740_Text": "Know this: none can escape their fate.",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_43741_Text": "Whence shall my blade strike? Look well!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_43742_Text": "Bear witness to the Unyielding Blade!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_43743_Text": "Do you truly believe you can run from me?",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_43744_Text": "Hah hah, good, good! Perhaps you shall not disappoint after all!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_43749_Text": "Behold the depths of my art!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_43750_Text": "Come now, you can do better than that!",
    "Instancecontenttextdata_43768_Text": "From where shall death take you? I shall grant you the mercy of foresight.",
    "Npcyell_2784_Text": "Lay down your weapons and the old man lives!",
    "music_Finality": "Finality",
    "music_What Moves the Heart": "What Moves the Heart"
}